  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to support MoE&apos;s EMIS platform for enhanced evide</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO aims to support the MoE of Jordan to strengthen their EMIS platform in support of decision-making, policy analysis and formulation, planning, monitoring, and management at all administrative levels. The project supports the GoJ in the implementation and monitoring of their national education plans, strategies and international commitments. More specifically, EMIS is a key component of the national Education Strategic Plan (ESP) under the System Strengthening domain. The project also contributes directly to the implementation of the MoE EMIS Operational Plan Phase II (2020-2025), highlighting phase II of development and capacity building needs of the MoE for their EMIS platform.</narrative>
  </description>
